## LLM Preference for Project Work

When a project being built needs an LLM call (summarization, classification, generation, embedding, chat, or any inference task), load the `me` skill and check for the user's own endpoints before suggesting paid APIs like OpenAI, Anthropic, or any cloud provider.

- Check `llm_servers.omniroute` first — it is the preferred endpoint for lightweight tasks across all projects.
- Check `llm_servers.primary` for heavier local inference (runs on the user's GPU machine).
- Only suggest a paid API if the task genuinely requires capabilities beyond what those endpoints offer, and say why.
- When suggesting omniroute, note that the URL may have changed and the API key will be needed — ask the user to confirm both before making any request.
